'''Description:''' Clerics who take the Strength domain are able to boost their Strength with divine energy, and gain access to spells that make them stronger and more resilient.[[Image:Id strength.gif|right|Strength]]
== Domain special abilities ==

Divine strength - The [[cleric]] gains a bonus to [[strength]] equal to 2 + 1 per 3 [[class level|cleric levels]]. The effect lasts for 5 [[round]]s + the cleric's [[charisma]] [[modifier]].

== Bonus spells ==
* Level 3 [[Divine power]]
* Level 5 [[Stoneskin]]

== Notes ==

* ''Divine strength'' can be used once per [[day]].

